{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2022-10-06 16:05:00', 'title': 'MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL CELEBRATES 10TH ANNIVERSARY, REAFFIRMS LONG-TERM GROWTH STRATEGY', 'text': 'CHICAGO, OCT. 06, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL (NASDAQ: MDLZ) TODAY CELEBRATED ITS 10TH ANNIVERSARY WITH A GLOBAL, ENTERPRISE-WIDE RECOMMITMENT TO ITS PURPOSE OF EMPOWERING PEOPLE TO SNACK RIGHT. ENTERING ITS SECOND DECADE, THE COMPANY IS WELL POSITIONED TO BECOME THE GLOBAL SNACKING LEADER BY WINNING IN CHOCOLATE, BISCUITS, AND BAKED SNACKS.'}